  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;TARIRO&apos;  Give HOPE to 100 women in rural Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TARIRO project will increase income for one hundred needy women in rural Zimbabwe. These women have no access to banks or jobs.  Desperately poor, their options are limited where resources are scarce. When these women learn to form savings groups - they will begin their journey to empower themselves, their families and most importantly, to restore hope - TARIRO.</narrative>
  </description>
